(Purpose) Tj T*
(This procedure defines how data integrity is carried out at Brookvale.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Scope) Tj T*
(Applies to all data integrity activities in production and quality control at Brookvale \(revised in revision 02\).) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Responsibilities) Tj T*
(The process owner, Maya Dorsey, maintains this procedure. Quality approves it \(revised in revision 02\) \(revised in revision 03\).) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Procedure) Tj T*
(Step 1: Record the result against the acceptance criterion.) Tj T*
(Step 2: Inspect the second-person check.) Tj T*
(Step 3: Confirm the batch number.) Tj T*
(Step 4: Clean the logbook entry.) Tj T*
(Step 5: Document the equipment status label.) Tj T*
(Step 6: Escalate deviations to Quality within one day.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Records) Tj T*
(Records of data integrity are kept for five years after batch expiry.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
